Jb. whereas, in 2021, the Commission rejected a complaint alleging the incompatibility of the LRT funding model with EU State aid rules, concluding that the measures at issue did not require prior notification to or approval by the Commission; whereas, on 21 May 2025 the General Court of the European Union annulled that decision in Case T-72/221, finding that the Commission had incorrectly assessed the applicability of the State aid coordination obligation in relation to the contested measures;

